OL,4,C'Our son will never be the same after  
OL,5,Crandom attack'                         
OL,6,GThe family of a 20-year-old man who    
OL,7,Gdoctors fear may never be the same     
OL,8,Gafter a violent, random assault have   
OL,9,Gappealed for witnesses to come forward.
OL,11,FAmari remains in a critical condition  
OL,12,Fin hospital weeks after he was         
OL,13,Fattacked near Sandy Lane Industrial    
OL,14,FEstate in Stourport-on-Severn,         
OL,15,FWorcestershire, on 2 October.          
OL,17,FDetectives said his injuries were      
OL,18,Flikely to be life-changing and that    
OL,19,Fthey did not know whether he would     
OL,20,Frecover.                               
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
