OL,4,CSafety fears after 35 crashes on city  
OL,5,Croad                                   
OL,6,GResidents and businesses are calling   
OL,7,Gfor safety improvements on a           
OL,8,GBirmingham road after dozens of        
OL,9,Gcrashes including one recent fatal one.
OL,11,FCampaigners say there have been 35     
OL,12,Fcollisions on Stratford Road in Hall   
OL,13,FGreen over the past 40 months,         
OL,14,Fincluding one in September in which a  
OL,15,F68-year-old man died when he was hit   
OL,16,Fby a vehicle.                          
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
