OL,4,CCanal breach could take months to      
OL,5,Crepair                                 
OL,6,GRepairs to a collapsed canal bank in   
OL,7,GShropshire are likely to take months,  
OL,8,Gthe Canal & River Trust has said.      
OL,10,FTwo homes were flooded when a large    
OL,11,Famount of water poured out following   
OL,12,Fthe collapse of a culvert beneath the  
OL,13,FLlangollen Canal at Hampton Bank just  
OL,14,Fover a week ago.                       
OL,16,FSince then a section of the canal has  
OL,17,Fbeen closed and six pumps have been    
OL,18,Finstalled to restore water levels.     
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
